请跟我一起进攻。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopHeal","label":"战斗-请求治疗","texts":{"zhCN":["好痛……谁来治疗我……！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopHeal"]},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["赶紧跑！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopRun"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["成功了！多亏有您。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["竟然是第一名，太厉害了！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["只要您不嫌弃我就好。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["请快一点！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["虽然出身卑微……您愿意相信我吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["您喜欢就好。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_nelluru_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_nelluru_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["我…我能搬动的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_nelluru_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_nelluru_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["请安静一点，卢纳少爷会被吵醒的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_nelluru_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_nelluru_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["像我这样的人，真的可以担任卢纳少爷的乳母吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_nelluru_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_nelluru_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["是信吗？是谁寄来的呢？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_nelluru_1_NoticeMail","cv_nelluru_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["庆典！？如果能到外面的世界去，我一直都很想去看看呢！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_nelluru_NoticeEvent"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["我是卢纳少爷的乳母，不准任何人伤害卢纳少爷。"]